{"title":"Java-SpringBoot的请求注解","slug":"Java-SpringBoot的请求注解","date":"2024-11-10T03:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-11-10T01:00:00.000Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/Java-SpringBoot的请求注解.json","excerpt":null,"covers":null,"content":"<h1 id=\"Java-SpringBoot的请求注解\"><a href=\"#Java-SpringBoot的请求注解\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Java-SpringBoot的请求注解\"></a>Java-SpringBoot的请求注解</h1><h2 id=\"1-RestController-注解\"><a href=\"#1-RestController-注解\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. @RestController 注解\"></a>1. @RestController 注解</h2><h3 id=\"1-1-RestController-的基本概念\"><a href=\"#1-1-RestController-的基本概念\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1.1 @RestController 的基本概念\"></a>1.1 @RestController 的基本概念</h3><p><code>@RestController</code>是一个特殊的Spring注解，用于创建RESTful控制器。<font style=\"color: red;\"><code>@RestController</code><br>等同于<code>@Controller</code>和<code>@ResponseBody</code>的组合</font>，意味着它不仅将类标记为Spring的控制器组件，还会将控制器方法的返回值直接作为HTTP响应体返回。</p>\n<p>在传统的Spring MVC应用中，通常会使用<code>@Controller</code>配合<code>@ResponseBody</code>来返回JSON格式的数据。然而，@RestController简化了这个过程，减少了额外的注解使用需求。</p>\n<h3 id=\"1-2-RestController-的使用示例\"><a href=\"#1-2-RestController-的使用示例\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1.2 @RestController 的使用示例\"></a>1.2 @RestController 的使用示例</h3><p>在Spring Boot应用中，我们可以直接在控制器类上使用@RestController来定义RESTful接口。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight java\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> org.springframework.web.bind.annotation.RestController;</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> org.springframework.web.bind.annotation.GetMapping;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">@RestController</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"title class_\">HelloController</span> &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"meta\">@GetMapping(&quot;/hello&quot;)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">public</span> String <span class=\"title function_\">sayHello</span><span class=\"params\">()</span> &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"string\">&quot;Hello, Spring Boot!&quot;</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h2 id=\"2-RequestMapping-注解\"><a href=\"#2-RequestMapping-注解\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. @RequestMapping 注解\"></a>2. @RequestMapping 注解</h2><h3 id=\"2-1-RequestMapping-的基本概念\"><a href=\"#2-1-RequestMapping-的基本概念\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2.1 @RequestMapping 的基本概念\"></a>2.1 @RequestMapping 的基本概念</h3><p><code>@RequestMapping</code>是Spring提供的一个用于映射HTTP请求到特定控制器方法或类的注解。通过<code>@RequestMapping</code><br>，我们可以定义请求的路径、HTTP方法、请求参数、请求头等。<code>@RequestMapping</code>可以应用于类级别或方法级别：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>类级别：用于定义一组共享的URL前缀，所有该类中的方法都会继承这个前缀。</li>\n<li>方法级别：用于映射具体的URL路径，并可以指定具体的HTTP请求类型（GET、POST等）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"2-2-RequestMapping-的属性\"><a href=\"#2-2-RequestMapping-的属性\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2.2 @RequestMapping 的属性\"></a>2.2 @RequestMapping 的属性</h3><p><code>@RequestMapping</code>支持多个属性配置，常见的有以下几种：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>value</code> / <code>path</code>：定义请求的URL路径。</li>\n<li><code>method</code>：指定HTTP请求的方法，如<code>RequestMethod.GET</code>、<code>RequestMethod.POST</code>等。</li>\n<li><code>params</code>：限定请求的参数条件，如<code>params=&quot;type=user&quot;</code>表示请求必须包含参数<code>type</code>且值为user。</li>\n<li><code>headers</code>：限定请求头条件，常用于特定内容类型的处理。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"2-3-RequestMapping-的使用示例\"><a href=\"#2-3-RequestMapping-的使用示例\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2.3 @RequestMapping 的使用示例\"></a>2.3 @RequestMapping 的使用示例</h3><figure class=\"highlight java\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> org.springframework.web.bind.annotation.RequestMapping;</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> org.springframework.web.bind.annotation.RequestMethod;</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> org.springframework.web.bind.annotation.RestController;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">@RestController</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">@RequestMapping(&quot;/api&quot;)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"title class_\">ApiController</span> &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"meta\">@RequestMapping(value = &quot;/greeting&quot;, method = RequestMethod.GET)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">public</span> String <span class=\"title function_\">getGreeting</span><span class=\"params\">()</span> &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"string\">&quot;Hello, API!&quot;</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"meta\">@RequestMapping(value = &quot;/greeting&quot;, method = RequestMethod.POST, params = &quot;name&quot;)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">public</span> String <span class=\"title function_\">postGreeting</span><span class=\"params\">(String name)</span> &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"string\">&quot;Hello, &quot;</span> + name + <span class=\"string\">&quot;!&quot;</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"meta\">@RequestMapping(value = &quot;/info&quot;, method = RequestMethod.GET, headers = &quot;content-type=application/json&quot;)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">public</span> String <span class=\"title function_\">getInfo</span><span class=\"params\">()</span> &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"string\">&quot;This is JSON content&quot;</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<ul>\n<li><code>@RequestMapping(&quot;/api&quot;)</code>定义了一个基础路径<code>/api</code>，所有方法的URL都将从该路径开始。</li>\n<li><code>getGreeting</code>方法通过<code>RequestMethod.GET</code>指定了只接受GET请求。</li>\n<li><code>postGreeting</code>方法指定了<code>params=&quot;name&quot;</code>，即只有带有<code>name</code>参数的POST请求才能被处理。</li>\n<li><code>getInfo</code>方法通过<code>headers=&quot;content-type=application/json&quot;</code>限定了只接受<code>Content-Type</code>为<code>application/json</code>的请求。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"2-4-RequestMapping-的简化方式\"><a href=\"#2-4-RequestMapping-的简化方式\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2.4 @RequestMapping 的简化方式\"></a>2.4 @RequestMapping 的简化方式</h3><p>在Spring 4.3之后，Spring提供了一组更加简洁的注解，这些注解是<code>@RequestMapping</code>的特定HTTP方法替代品：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>@GetMapping</code>：相当于<code>@RequestMapping</code>加<code>RequestMethod.GET</code>。</li>\n<li><code>@PostMapping</code>：相当于<code>@RequestMapping</code>加<code>RequestMethod.POST</code>。</li>\n<li><code>@PutMapping</code>：相当于<code>@RequestMapping</code>加<code>RequestMethod.PUT</code>。</li>\n<li><code>@DeleteMapping</code>：相当于<code>@RequestMapping</code>加<code>RequestMethod.DELETE</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n","more":"<h1 id=\"Java-SpringBoot的请求注解\"><a href=\"#Java-SpringBoot的请求注解\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Java-SpringBoot的请求注解\"></a>Java-SpringBoot的请求注解</h1><h2 id=\"1-RestController-注解\"><a href=\"#1-RestController-注解\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. @RestController 注解\"></a>1. @RestController 注解</h2><h3 id=\"1-1-RestController-的基本概念\"><a href=\"#1-1-RestController-的基本概念\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1.1 @RestController 的基本概念\"></a>1.1 @RestController 的基本概念</h3><p><code>@RestController</code>是一个特殊的Spring注解，用于创建RESTful控制器。<font style=\"color: red;\"><code>@RestController</code><br>等同于<code>@Controller</code>和<code>@ResponseBody</code>的组合</font>，意味着它不仅将类标记为Spring的控制器组件，还会将控制器方法的返回值直接作为HTTP响应体返回。</p>\n<p>在传统的Spring MVC应用中，通常会使用<code>@Controller</code>配合<code>@ResponseBody</code>来返回JSON格式的数据。然而，@RestController简化了这个过程，减少了额外的注解使用需求。</p>\n<h3 id=\"1-2-RestController-的使用示例\"><a href=\"#1-2-RestController-的使用示例\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1.2 @RestController 的使用示例\"></a>1.2 @RestController 的使用示例</h3><p>在Spring Boot应用中，我们可以直接在控制器类上使用@RestController来定义RESTful接口。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight java\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> org.springframework.web.bind.annotation.RestController;</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> org.springframework.web.bind.annotation.GetMapping;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">@RestController</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"title class_\">HelloController</span> &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"meta\">@GetMapping(&quot;/hello&quot;)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">public</span> String <span class=\"title function_\">sayHello</span><span class=\"params\">()</span> &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"string\">&quot;Hello, Spring Boot!&quot;</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h2 id=\"2-RequestMapping-注解\"><a href=\"#2-RequestMapping-注解\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. @RequestMapping 注解\"></a>2. @RequestMapping 注解</h2><h3 id=\"2-1-RequestMapping-的基本概念\"><a href=\"#2-1-RequestMapping-的基本概念\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2.1 @RequestMapping 的基本概念\"></a>2.1 @RequestMapping 的基本概念</h3><p><code>@RequestMapping</code>是Spring提供的一个用于映射HTTP请求到特定控制器方法或类的注解。通过<code>@RequestMapping</code><br>，我们可以定义请求的路径、HTTP方法、请求参数、请求头等。<code>@RequestMapping</code>可以应用于类级别或方法级别：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>类级别：用于定义一组共享的URL前缀，所有该类中的方法都会继承这个前缀。</li>\n<li>方法级别：用于映射具体的URL路径，并可以指定具体的HTTP请求类型（GET、POST等）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"2-2-RequestMapping-的属性\"><a href=\"#2-2-RequestMapping-的属性\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2.2 @RequestMapping 的属性\"></a>2.2 @RequestMapping 的属性</h3><p><code>@RequestMapping</code>支持多个属性配置，常见的有以下几种：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>value</code> / <code>path</code>：定义请求的URL路径。</li>\n<li><code>method</code>：指定HTTP请求的方法，如<code>RequestMethod.GET</code>、<code>RequestMethod.POST</code>等。</li>\n<li><code>params</code>：限定请求的参数条件，如<code>params=&quot;type=user&quot;</code>表示请求必须包含参数<code>type</code>且值为user。</li>\n<li><code>headers</code>：限定请求头条件，常用于特定内容类型的处理。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"2-3-RequestMapping-的使用示例\"><a href=\"#2-3-RequestMapping-的使用示例\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2.3 @RequestMapping 的使用示例\"></a>2.3 @RequestMapping 的使用示例</h3><figure class=\"highlight java\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> org.springframework.web.bind.annotation.RequestMapping;</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> org.springframework.web.bind.annotation.RequestMethod;</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> org.springframework.web.bind.annotation.RestController;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">@RestController</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">@RequestMapping(&quot;/api&quot;)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"title class_\">ApiController</span> &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"meta\">@RequestMapping(value = &quot;/greeting&quot;, method = RequestMethod.GET)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">public</span> String <span class=\"title function_\">getGreeting</span><span class=\"params\">()</span> &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"string\">&quot;Hello, API!&quot;</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"meta\">@RequestMapping(value = &quot;/greeting&quot;, method = RequestMethod.POST, params = &quot;name&quot;)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">public</span> String <span class=\"title function_\">postGreeting</span><span class=\"params\">(String name)</span> &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"string\">&quot;Hello, &quot;</span> + name + <span class=\"string\">&quot;!&quot;</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"meta\">@RequestMapping(value = &quot;/info&quot;, method = RequestMethod.GET, headers = &quot;content-type=application/json&quot;)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">public</span> String <span class=\"title function_\">getInfo</span><span class=\"params\">()</span> &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"string\">&quot;This is JSON content&quot;</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<ul>\n<li><code>@RequestMapping(&quot;/api&quot;)</code>定义了一个基础路径<code>/api</code>，所有方法的URL都将从该路径开始。</li>\n<li><code>getGreeting</code>方法通过<code>RequestMethod.GET</code>指定了只接受GET请求。</li>\n<li><code>postGreeting</code>方法指定了<code>params=&quot;name&quot;</code>，即只有带有<code>name</code>参数的POST请求才能被处理。</li>\n<li><code>getInfo</code>方法通过<code>headers=&quot;content-type=application/json&quot;</code>限定了只接受<code>Content-Type</code>为<code>application/json</code>的请求。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"2-4-RequestMapping-的简化方式\"><a href=\"#2-4-RequestMapping-的简化方式\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2.4 @RequestMapping 的简化方式\"></a>2.4 @RequestMapping 的简化方式</h3><p>在Spring 4.3之后，Spring提供了一组更加简洁的注解，这些注解是<code>@RequestMapping</code>的特定HTTP方法替代品：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>@GetMapping</code>：相当于<code>@RequestMapping</code>加<code>RequestMethod.GET</code>。</li>\n<li><code>@PostMapping</code>：相当于<code>@RequestMapping</code>加<code>RequestMethod.POST</code>。</li>\n<li><code>@PutMapping</code>：相当于<code>@RequestMapping</code>加<code>RequestMethod.PUT</code>。</li>\n<li><code>@DeleteMapping</code>：相当于<code>@RequestMapping</code>加<code>RequestMethod.DELETE</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n","categories":[{"name":"Java","path":"api/categories/Java.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"Java","path":"api/tags/Java.json"},{"name":"SpringBoot","path":"api/tags/SpringBoot.json"}]}